OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers told not to pursue car on
OL,4,Awrong side of motorway, says police
OL,5,Abody
OL,6,
OL,7,FGardai (Irish police) were instructed
OL,8,Fto disengage from pursuing a car as it
OL,9,Fdrove in the wrong direction on a
OL,10,Fmotorway before a fatal crash, the
OL,11,FGarda Representative Association has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FFive teenagers were killed in the
OL,15,Fhead-on crash on the M9 in County
OL,16,FKildare on Sunday morning.
OL,18,FTwo women are in a critical condition,
OL,19,Fwhile another woman and a
OL,20,Fseven-year-old boy are in a serious
OL,21,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
