OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers told not to pursue car on
OL,4,Awrong side of motorway, says police
OL,5,Abody
OL,6,
OL,7,FAssistant General Secretary of the
OL,8,FGarda Representative Association (GRA),
OL,9,FTara McManus, told the BBC that garda
OL,10,Froads policing officers "do not have
OL,11,Fpursuit training".
